[Options]

[A.]
<h2>So it Ends...</h2>
<i>"After war comes peace, then peace brings war.  It goes on and on and on..."<br>
--Jake Darthan, Nimbian Priest.</i>  
<p>It has begun....The beginning of the end...of the war that is.  All of your allies have flown in to the final conflict of this war.  You now seperated from the fight see a battle which many of the other generals and lords have stayed clear of.  This you know is where you shall find your greatest foes and the path to glory....

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>~[Ibanner.*]Success!~[Ibanner.*]</h2>
<p>
Victory is yours!!!  With defeat of your last foe many submit to your rule.  The rest flee for their lives or are slain.  After your many goals and conquests you have finally gain what you deserved in the beginning...the rulership of all of Nimbus!!
$Button=Ok,Tell,victory

[victory]
<p>Your losses were great.  Among the friends you lost was the Page of Thunder, one of the first allies you ever had.  Truly nothing is without cost for the Knight of Wind has also vanished...
$Button=Ok,Tell,victory2

[victory2]
<p>Many celebrations are held in your honour for many months to come, but you still have the hard task of keeping the Nimbians of Nimbus united...  For now you celebrate!
$Button=Ok,Tell,m1

[m1]
<h2>Duke of Thunder:</h2>
<p>Ahh here is our guest of honour now.
$Timeout=5,tell,m2
$Button=Ok,Tell,m2

[m2]
<h2>Squire of Rain:</h2>
<p>You are truly a great warrior my friend.  It was an honour fighting along with you and your clan.
$Timeout=9,tell,m3
$Button=Ok,Tell,m3

[m3]
<h2>Duke of Thunder:</h2>
<p>Three cheers for the new ruler of Nimbus!!
$Timeout=4,tell,m4
$Button=Ok,Tell,m4

[m4]
<h2>All:</h2>
<p>Hip-Hip Horray!!
$Timeout=2,tell,m5
$Button=Ok,Tell,m5

[m5]
