<p>Hip-Hip Horray!!
$Timeout=2,tell,m6
$Button=Ok,Tell,m6

[m6]
<h2>All:</h2>
<p>HIP-HIP HORRAY!!!
$Timeout=5,tell,m7
$Button=Ok,Tell,m7

[m7]
<h2>Govener of Sun:</h2>
<p>We still have the remaining resistance to deal with, but until then....

