[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>Message from Fanhal the Destroyer</h2>
<p>
I will never surrender to you!!!

[ai3PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Galenhol the Great</h2>
<p>
I'd rather die then be ruled over by the likes of you!

[ai4TPriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from Nilan the Storm Lord</h2>
